From 31e34a40eb045b77a282d5322d9c70126b13b4f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Belfry <belfry@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:38:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Belfry: no third-party services; members create rooms

Removes the Plausible analytics script and its CSP entry, reads the dufflepud proxy from
VITE_DUFFLEPUD_URL (empty turns off link previews and the read-marker sync, NIP-05 handles
are fetched directly), lets an empty VITE_PUSH_BRIDGE turn the push bridge off, and with
VITE_MEMBERS_CREATE_ROOMS=true shows "Create room" to every member of the space (the relay
decides, zooid with Belfry's member_create patch).
